Description: Supervised learning nodes for trama workflows, from linear
    baselines and interpretable CART and FIGS models to random forests,
    support vector machines and gradient boosted trees. Provides reproducible
    training and test splits, prediction, evaluation and model inspection.
    Learning engines are optional and loaded only for the selected model.
    Neural networks are deliberately outside the scope of this collection.
